### ==============================================================================
### FASE 5: REST API CLIENT (WORKFLOW APPROVAL, SUBMISSION ACCESS & NOTIFICATIONS)
### Format: VS Code REST Client
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Ambil Token CSRF
# @name getCsrf
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/csrf
Content-Type: application/json

###
@csrfToken = {{getCsrf.response.body.csrf_token}}

### 2. Login sebagai PIC Unit (Rina)
# @name loginPIC
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "rina@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Cek Status Akses Efektif Dokumen Anggaran (BR-10, BR-12)
GET {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/access
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Ajukan Dokumen Anggaran ke Manager (FR-W1: DRAFT/DIKEMBALIKAN -> DIAJUKAN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### 5. Lihat Riwayat Status Dokumen Anggaran
GET {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/history
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Login sebagai Manager Unit (Budi)
# @name loginManager
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "budi@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 7. Ambil Antrian Telaah Dokumen (Review Queue Manager)
GET {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/review-queue?type=BIAYA
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Tambah Komentar pada Baris Dokumen (FR-W5)
# @name addComment
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/line-comments
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "line_id": 1,
  "line_type": "EXPENSE",
  "comment": "Mohon kurangi kuantitas ATK ini dari 50 menjadi 30 pack sesuai arahan penghematan."
}

###
@commentId = {{addComment.response.body.comment_id}}

### 9. Ambil Seluruh Komentar Baris pada Dokumen
GET {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/line-comments
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. Hapus Komentar Baris Milik Sendiri
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/line-comments/{{commentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### 11. Setujui Dokumen Anggaran (FR-W2, BR-07 Maker-Checker Guard)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/approve
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### 12. Kembalikan Dokumen dengan Catatan Wajib (BR-08, BR-14 Auto-Return)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/return
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "note": "Kuantitas anggaran biaya masih melebihi plafon target unit kerja. Mohon disesuaikan kembali."
}

### 13. Login sebagai Tim Akuntansi (Dya)
# @name loginAkuntansi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "dya@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 14. Ambil Antrian Telaah Dokumen Tingkat Akuntansi (Semua Unit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/review-queue?status=DISETUJUI
Content-Type: application/json

### 15. Finalisasi Dokumen Tunggal (FINAL)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/finalize
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### 16. Finalisasi Dokumen Secara Massal (Bulk Finalize)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/finalize-bulk
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "doc_ids": [1, 2]
}

### 17. Buka Kembali Dokumen FINAL dengan Alasan Wajib (BR-06)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/1/reopen
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "reason": "Penyesuaian target RKAP korporat hasil arahan Direksi untuk tahun berjalan."
}

### 18. Perbarui Batas Waktu Periode (FR-P5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/periods/1/deadlines
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "fill_deadline": "2026-11-25T23:59:59.000Z",
  "review_deadline": "2026-12-05T23:59:59.000Z"
}

### 19. Buka / Tutup Pengajuan Tingkat Periode (FR-P6, BR-12 Alasan Wajib saat Buka)
POST {{baseUrl}}/periods/1/toggle-submission
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "state": "BUKA",
  "reason": "Pembukaan masa perpanjangan pengisian revisi anggaran unit kerja."
}

### 20. Ambil Matriks Status Akses Unit Kerja per Periode (FR-P7)
GET {{baseUrl}}/periods/1/unit-access
Content-Type: application/json

### 21. Override Akses Pengajuan Unit Spesifik (FR-P8, BR-12)
POST {{baseUrl}}/periods/1/units/1/submission-access
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "doc_type": "BIAYA",
  "state": "BUKA",
  "effective_deadline": "2026-11-30T23:59:59.000Z",
  "reason": "Pemberian dispensasi pengisian perbaikan anggaran unit Rawat Inap."
}

### 22. Override Akses Pengajuan Massal (Bulk Override)
POST {{baseUrl}}/periods/1/bulk-submission-access
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "unit_ids": [1, 2],
  "doc_type": "ALL",
  "state": "TUTUP"
}

### 23. Ambil Daftar Notifikasi Pengguna Terkini (FR-P9)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

### 24. Tandai Satu Notifikasi Sudah Dibaca
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notifications/1/read
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### 25. Tandai Seluruh Notifikasi Sudah Dibaca
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/read-all
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
